abstract: >
  Camera-based collision avoidance module for SEANO USV built on ROS 2 Humble,
  validated using ArduPilot SITL (ArduRover rover-skid) and designed for Jetson deployment.
  The control interface prioritizes left/right (differential thrust) commands with a safety-limited actuation pipeline.

